For comparison run
```bash
./md.x param* > out*.dat
``` 
Then modify initial chain file to chain3D_*.xyz and run
```bash
./md.x param* > 3Dout*.dat
``` 
where * = [1,2,3,4]

In order to compare different datasets merge two column files into one
```bash
paste file1.dat file2.dat > file12.dat
```

### gnuplot fit
When fitting, first declare initial variable values:
```bash
a = 1.0
```